<title>UK: EIB prices 250 mln stg Dec 2006 fungible bond.</title>
<headline>EIB prices 250 mln stg Dec 2006 fungible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible has been priced lead manager HSBC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *250 MLN STG   COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    07.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.963   PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    100.963   SPREAD	+10.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-500  SALE LIMITS UK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5 BP    SELL CONC  27.5 BP   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 700 MLN STG BOND</p>
<p>		PLUS 182 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
